title: 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
<<wait 1>>
(As I head to school and climb the stairs in front of the main gate, I see EunPyo sitting on a bench.)
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: Hey, {name()}!
{name()}: Oh, hey.
{name()}: You don't have a class right now, do you?
{name()}: You're here really early.
EunPyo: I just woke up early today...
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Since I was already up, I just came straight to school.
{name()}: That's not easy to do.
{name()}: Personally, I want to spend as little time at school as possible.
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: Actually, I’ve been enjoying coming to school lately.
{name()}: Really? Why?
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: Well... because {name()} is here when I come?
(EunPyo smiled shyly.)
{name()}: What's with that? You're making me blush.
<<if get("lvPyo") >= 50>>
    EunPyo: Don't you feel good seeing me too?
    EunPyo: Even last night, I couldn't sleep properly because I wanted to see you so soon......
<<endif>>
(The morning breeze is especially cold today.)
<<choice 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_긍1_영문 "Let's go in together." 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_부1_영문 "I'll head in first." >>
(Should I ask her to go in together?)
===

title: 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_긍1_영문
---
{name()}: Have you been sitting here this whole time?
{name()}: Aren't you cold? Let's go in together.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Yeah, I'd love to. 
<<jump 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_부1_영문
---
{name()}: Have you been sitting here this whole time?
{name()}: I'm going to head in first.
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: Oh, no.
EunPyo: Let's go in together.
<<jump 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_분기1_영문
---
(EunPyo stands up from the bench and follows me.)
(As she stands next to me, I feel a chill radiating from her.)
(Just how long has she been sitting out here?)
(EunPyo links her arm with mine.)
EunPyo: You have class next period, right?
<<choice 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_긍2_영문 "Yeah, I need to stop by the 3rd-floor lab for a bit." 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_부2_영문 "No, I'm just killing time." >>
EunPyo: Do you have any plans right now?
===

title: 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_긍2_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
{name()}: Yeah, I need to stop by the 3rd-floor lab for a bit.
{name()}: How about you?
EunPyo: I don't have anything.
EunPyo: I'll walk you to the 3rd floor.
<<show pyo_smile>>
{name()}: I'd like that, then.
<<bg 낮_강의실>>
(We walked up to the 3rd floor together.)
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: See you in the lecture hall in a bit.
<<if get("lvPyo") >= 50>>
    <<show pyo_blush>>
    EunPyo: I'll save a seat for you...
<<endif>>
<<end>>
===

title: 주4_목_1교시_정문_서은표_부2_영문
---
{name()}: No, I'm just killing time.
<<play 서은표_흠>>
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Perfect. Want to relax in the club room together?
{name()}: Sure. Let's head to the club room.
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
<<bg 낮_동아리방>>
<<show pyo_idle>>
(We moved to the club room.)
(We spent some time watching anime clips together.)
EunPyo: See you in the lecture hall in a bit.
<<if get("lvPyo") >= 50>>
    <<show pyo_blush>>
    EunPyo: I'll save a seat for you...
<<endif>>
<<end>>
===